<title>USA: Shiva, NETCOM form alliance.</title>
<headline>Shiva, NETCOM form alliance.</headline>
<dateline>BEDFORD, Mass. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shiva Corp and NETCOM On-Line Communication Services said Monday they have formed an alliance that would make it easier for Value Added Resellers, intermediaries between manufacturers and their customers, to provide remote internet and intranet access.</p>
<p>The alliance permits resellers to sell Shiva's access equipment and NETCOM's nationwide Internet services, eliminating the need for resellers to negotiate with multiple vendors for equipment and service, said Mylissa Tsai, a spokeswoman for Shiva.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
